OPENQASM 3.0;
bit[3] b;
qubit[3] q;
barrier q[0], q[1], q[2];
b[0] = measure q[0];
b[1] = measure q[1];
b[2] = measure q[2];
```

```python
from braket.circuits import Circuit

circ = Circuit().delay([0, 1, 2], 30)

print(circ.to_ir("OPENQASM").source)
```



#### OUTPUT
